  <!-- Status bar modifier icon. One glyph = 16x15dp, two = 32x15dp: at 15dp tall the status bar
       draws the icon unscaled, and 16dp/32dp are whole pixels on the usual densities, so the pair
       is exactly twice the single. The art keeps its 144x72 grid (Shift in x 72..144) and the
       group moves it so the right-hand glyph is the same distance from the icon's right edge in
       both: Shift does not move when Alt or Ctrl joins it. -->
